OL,3,GNEWSA380-home scheme approved despite
OL,4,Abridge concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 400 homes have been approved on
OL,7,Fthe edge of a town after a developer
OL,8,Fsought to reassure councillors that a
OL,9,Fpromised railway bridge would be built.
OL,11,FParish councillors have asked for
OL,12,Fconfirmation that a new two-way railway
OL,13,Fbridge would be constructed as part of
OL,14,Fthe Persimmon Homes development on land
OL,15,Foff Westfield Road in Dereham, Norfolk.
OL,17,FThey say the crossing is essential to
OL,18,Favoid traffic issues, but there has
OL,19,Fbeen little visible progress towards
OL,20,Fthe project.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
